.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_LINK_PLAN_NOTE_INCREMENTAL 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_link_plan_note_incremental
.Nd emit one incremental-note event through a link plan callback
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_note_incremental "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "const char *key" "const char *value"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
If an incremental hook is installed,
.Fn elf_link_plan_note_incremental
invokes it with
.Fa key
and
.Fa value
(or empty strings for NULL arguments).
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv ELF_OK
on success, or
.Dv ELF_ERR_STATE
if
.Fa plan
is NULL.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_link_plan_set_incremental_hook 3
